# --- Claude Code / GSD tooling ---
# GSD install (~14 MB, reinstallable via `npx @opengsd/gsd-core@latest --claude --local`)
# and machine-local settings stay out of git; the project guide is versioned.
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md

# GSD research web-search cache (regenerable)
.planning/research/.cache/

